1
00:05:38,823 --> 00:05:44,823
Flying Home is a romance film directed by Dominique Deruddere.

2
00:11:17,647 --> 00:11:23,647
Colin, an ambitious young American businessman, has a deal with a potential
client, a rich Arab sheikh who is a passionate pigeon fancier.

3
00:16:56,470 --> 00:17:02,470
The sheikh has tried several times to buy a champion pigeon, but
the owner continues to stubbornly refuse his offer.

4
00:22:35,294 --> 00:22:41,294
In an attempt to gain the trust of the Sheikh, Colin offers him a deal: if he manages to convince the
owner to sell the champion pigeon, the sheikh will agree to do business with Colin's company.

5
00:28:14,117 --> 00:28:20,117
But when Colin meets Jos, the grumpy owner of the pigeon, and Isabella, his
granddaughter, he realizes that this mission will not be as easy as he had hoped.

6
00:33:52,941 --> 00:33:58,941
Colin, played by Jamie Dornan.

7
00:39:31,764 --> 00:39:37,764
Isabelle Pauwels, played by Charlotte De Bruyne.

8
00:45:10,588 --> 00:45:16,588
Jos Pauwels, played by Jan Decleir.

9
00:50:49,411 --> 00:50:55,411
Sheikh, played by Ali Suliman.

10
00:56:28,235 --> 00:56:34,235
Priest, played by Josse De Pauw.

11
01:02:07,058 --> 01:02:13,058
Martha, played by Viviane de Muynck.

12
01:07:45,882 --> 01:07:51,882
Flying Home (a.k.a.

13
01:13:24,705 --> 01:13:30,705
Racing Hearts) is a 2014 romantic drama film directed by Dominique
Deruddere and also written by Dominique Deruddere.

14
01:19:03,529 --> 01:19:09,529
The film was released in 2 April 2014.

15
01:24:42,352 --> 01:24:48,352
The film explores themes of grandfather, betrayal, pigeon.

16
01:30:21,176 --> 01:30:27,176
The tone is emotional.
